# QUESTION : REDIS KYA HAI AUR KAISE KAAM KARTA HAI ? 
=======================================================

- Redis ek fast, in-memory data store hai jo primarily data ko RAM me store karta hai. 
  Ye Application aur Database ke beech ek fast-access data layer provide karta hai. 
  Durability/recovery ke liye Redis data ko disk par bhi persist karta hai.

- Generally, distributed systems me caching ke context me Redis ko Application aur Database
  ke beech ek external, distributed Cache ke roop me use kiya ja sakta hai — jise multiple 
  application instances access kar sakti hain.

- Redis fundamentally key-value data model provide karta hai.

  Example:

  Key:    product:101

  Value:  {
           "id": 101,
           "name": "iPhone",
           "price": 79999
          }


 Application → GET product:101  →  Redis  →  Corresponding Value


