## QUESTION : REDIS KEY KAISE CREATE HOTI HAI APPLICATION ME ?
----------------------------------------------------------------

Redis key ka fixed format nahi hota; developer naming convention define karta hai.

Common Pattern: <resource>:<identifier>

Example: GET /products/101 → productId = 101

Application naming convention ke according key banati hai:

Redis Key = "product:" + productId → product:101



------------------------------------------------
## QUESTION : REDIS KEY MAI TTL KYA HOTA HAI ?
------------------------------------------------

Redis keys ke saath TTL (Time To Live) set kiya ja sakta hai matlab 
ye define karte hain ki key maximum kitni der tak Redis me rahegi.

Example:

product:101  →  TTL = 10 minutes

TTL expire hone ke baad key Redis me available nahi rahegi. Agar usi key ke liye next request aaye, 
to data Redis me nahi milega (Cache Miss). Application Database se fresh data retrieve karegi, usse 
Redis me dobara cache karegi, phir se TTL set karegi, aur client ko response return karegi.



